 items</text></g></g><g data-sc-role="source" data-sc-pointer="/slides/0/sources"><g font-kerning="none" font-variant-ligatures="none"><text x="57.6" y="653.94" font-family="Liberation Sans" font-size="10.67" fill="#5B6B7F" xml:space="preserve">Illustrative data. Source: Source ops-review</text></g></g></svg>"`;

