.</text></g></g><g data-sc-role="panel"><rect x="859.02" y="176.64" width="363.34" height="460.8" fill="#F2F5F9" stroke="none"/></g><g data-sc-role="panel-accent"><rect x="859.02" y="176.64" width="5.76" height="460.8" fill="#1F5FBF" stroke="none"/></g><g data-sc-role="takeaway" data-sc-pointer="/slides/0/takeaway/headline"><g font-kerning="none" font-variant-ligatures="none"><text x="887.82" y="224.37" font-family="Liberation Sans" font-size="20" font-weight="bold" fill="#0B1F3A" xml:space="preserve">SMB grows revenue but</text><text x="887.82" y="248.37" font-family="Liberation Sans" font-size="20" font-weight="bold" fill="#0B1F3A" xml:space="preserve">destroys value</text></g></g><g data-sc-role="body" data-sc-pointer="/slides/0/takeaway/points"><g font-kerning="none" font-variant-ligatures="none"><text x="887.82" y="295.11" font-family="Liberation Sans" font-size="18.67" fill="#0B1F3A">•</text><text x="906.49" y="295.11" font-family="Liberation Sans" font-size="18.67" fill="#0B1F3A" xml:space="preserve">Support cost per SMB account is</text><text x="906.49" y="317.51" font-family="Liberation Sans" font-size="18.67" fill="#0B1F3A" xml:space="preserve">3× the enterprise level</text><text x="887.82" y="350.58" font-family="Liberation Sans" font-size="18.67" fill="#0B1F3A">•</text><text x="906.49" y="350.58" font-family="Liberation Sans" font-size="18.67" fill="#0B1F3A" xml:space="preserve">Net retention below 100% means</text><text x="906.49" y="372.98" font-family="Liberation Sans" font-size="18.67" fill="#0B1F3A" xml:space="preserve">growth depends on new logos</text></g></g><g data-sc-role="source" data-sc-pointer="/slides/0/sources"><g font-kerning="none" font-variant-ligatures="none"><text x="57.6" y="653.94" font-family="Liberation Sans" font-size="10.67" fill="#5B6B7F" xml:space="preserve">Illustrative data. Source: Source finance-fy25</text></g></g></svg>"`;

